    <div class="intro-content the-economy">
        <p class="icon-type-label icon-type-speech">Speech</p>

        <h1 itemprop="name">Monetary Policy and Productivity</h1>

            <div class="intro-author">

<div class="author-img">

                        <img src=/-/media/FRBP/Assets/Images/People/Executive-Leadership/25-06_Anna-Paulson.jpg alt="Anna Paulson" />
                    </div>

                <div class="author-desc">
                    <p class="author-by">by</p>
                        <a href=/our-people/anna-paulson class="author-name" itemprop="author">Anna Paulson</a>
                    <p class="author-title">President and Chief Executive Officer</p>
                </div>
            </div>

        <p class="article-date-published" itemprop="datePublished">27 Mar ’26</p>

        <p class="intro-excerpt" itemprop="description">Philadelphia Fed President and CEO Anna Paulson delivered a keynote speech at the Federal Reserve Bank of San Francisco's Macroeconomics and Monetary Policy Conference, where she addressed key challenges facing monetary policymakers in the current economic environment.</p>

